LWxCNjZTV2gwa3cxUFpBQ2s5S3hfVWNRdVI5Y2FCeVVYTktDLXVTMm8wdmNSMS1zcTBzVmtsNEFfXzBVdU55TUxxV19YRWR2cWhxdEJSaXBmekxhc2ViQjYyNk9BenBKbThUWTRGNkp0WFdld1VPdzV3bVFIeEFiQkRhNlRB?oc=5","date":"2026-10-14","zh":"儘管銷售額成長了 22%，為何 Qnity (NYSE:Q) 仍陷入死亡十字？"},{"title":"Qnity Electronics: Attractive Materials Economics, An Unfinished Cash Test (NYSE:Q)","src":"Seeking Alpha","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNNnV2djF0T2F6LUJVcnJueTR0bEVsdkU1ampoWk9Ka3ctU3lELWYxc0hfdW96MG13NEpsZ19JS21SdFU2LU11ZlNyeTZ4dDdlbkdkLVFaVEZkZ3BVaEhuQll3ZTVOQW4yZDBGXy1OV0x3NGxjamVWbG1UeVFudmtyMFAya0VnTmxDbWg1N21LRkxza2dNZm1kLTJxNEU3X0g1ZzA5RnNFOS1yeG5UazVSV1RIRQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-12","zh":"Qnity Electronics：有吸引力的材料經濟學，未完成的現金測試（NYSE：Q）"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":6},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"半導體/晶片","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-26","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2058873/000205887326000010/q-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Qnity is one of the largest global leaders in materials and solutions for the semiconductor and electronics industries. We empower our customers' technology roadmaps to enable advancements in megatrends such as artificial intelligence, high-performance computing and advanced connectivity. We partner with leading semiconductor and advanced device manufacturers to address complex challenges and develop solutions that facilitate next-generation technological innovations. With over 50 years of experience in systems engineering and material science, a global manufacturing footprint and major application labs across the world, we are well-positioned to capitalize on emerging opportunities across various sectors including data centers, communications infrastructure, industrials, automotive, and consumer electronics.","zh":"Qnity 是半導體和電子產業材料和解決方案的全球最大領導者之一。我們為客戶的技術路線圖提供支持，以推動人工智慧、高效能運算和進階連接等大趨勢的進步。我們與領先的半導體和先進設備製造商合作，應對複雜的挑戰並開發促進下一代技術創新的解決方案。憑藉在系統工程和材料科學領域超過 50 年的經驗、全球製造足跡以及遍布世界各地的主要應用實驗室，我們處於有利地位，能夠充分利用資料中心、通訊基礎設施、工業、汽車和消費電子等各個領域的新興機會。"},{"en":"On May 22, 2024, DuPont de Nemours, Inc. (\"DuPont\" or \"Parent\") announced its plan to separate Qnity from DuPont into an independent publicly traded company (the \"Separation\"). On November 1, 2025 (the \"Separation and Distribution Date\"), DuPont completed the Separation through a pro-rata distribution of one share of Qnity common stock for every two shares of DuPont common stock held at the close of business on the record date of October 22, 2025 (the \"Distribution\"). As a result of the Distribution, as of the Separation and Distribution Date, Qnity became an independent, publicly traded company, and Qnity common stock commenced trading on the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol \"Q\" at the start of trading on November 3, 2025.","zh":"2024 年 5 月 22 日，杜邦 de Nemours, Inc.（「杜邦」或「母公司」）宣布計畫將 Qnity 從杜邦分拆為獨立的上市公司（「分拆」）。 2025 年 11 月 1 日（「分拆和分配日」），杜邦公司透過在 2025 年 10 月 22 日營業結束時持有的每 2 股杜邦普通股按比例分配一股 Qnity 普通股的方式完成了分拆（「分配」）。由於分派，自分拆和分派日起，Qnity 成為一家獨立的公開交易公司，Qnity 普通股於 2025 年 11 月 3 日開始在紐約證券交易所開始交易，代號為「Q」。"},{"en":"Semiconductor Technologies: Our Semiconductor Technologies segment provides a portfolio of innovative materials and solutions utilized across multiple stages of the semiconductor manufacturing process. These advanced materials are qualified into customers' roadmaps, designed to improve chip performance, enhance yield and enable leading-edge node technology.","zh":"半導體技術：我們的半導體技術部門提供在半導體製造過程的多個階段使用的創新材料和解決方案組合。這些先進材料符合客戶的路線圖，旨在提高晶片性能、提高產量並實現領先的節點技術。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"We are a trusted partner within the electronics manufacturing ecosystem, with collaborative relationships with OEMs and industry partners who specify our materials for their final product. We work as a design partner with OEMs, often working directly through their fabricator network. Our diverse customer base includes semiconductor device manufacturers and foundries, equipment providers, circuit board manufacturers and other intermediaries within the electronics value chain. Our global operations enable us to maintain local knowledge and a presence that is close to our customers.","zh":"我們是電子製造生態系統中值得信賴的合作夥伴，與 OEM 和產業合作夥伴建立了合作關係，他們為他們的最終產品指定了我們的材料。我們作為原始設備製造商的設計合作夥伴，通常直接透過他們的製造商網路進行合作。我們多元化的客戶群包括半導體裝置製造商和代工廠、設備供應商、電路板製造商以及電子價值鏈中的其他中間商。我們的全球營運使我們能夠保持對當地的了解並貼近客戶。"},{"en":"Notably, the average length of our relationship with our top 10 customers exceeds 30 years, solidifying our position as a partner of choice throughout the electronics value chain. We are proud to count nearly all of the world's top 20 largest semiconductor manufacturers among our customers. While we have contracts with certain top customers, these contracts do not contain long-term purchase commitments. Instead, we work closely with our customers to develop non-binding forecasts for the purchase and sale of our products over the short-term and pursuant to certain payment terms and conditions based on the type and location of the customer and the products or services purchased. Our customers may cancel their orders, change production quantities from forecasted volumes or delay production for reasons beyond our control. Our business is not substantially dependent on any contract.","zh":"值得注意的是，我們與前 10 位客戶的平均合作關係超過 30 年，鞏固了我們作為整個電子價值鏈首選合作夥伴的地位。我們的客戶幾乎涵蓋了全球 20 家最大的半導體製造商，對此我們深感自豪。雖然我們與某些頂級客戶簽訂了合同，但這些合約不包含長期購買承諾。相反，我們與客戶密切合作，根據客戶的類型和地點以及所購買的產品或服務，根據某些付款條款和條件，制定短期內購買和銷售我們產品的非約束性預測。我們的客戶可能會因我們無法控制的原因取消訂單、更改預測產量或延遲生產。我們的業務基本上不依賴任何合約。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Competition in the markets in which we participate is through a range of products and services, based upon performance, quality, reliability, brand, reputation, service and support. We provide extensive support, technical services and testing services for our customers, in addition to new product development. The electronics materials market is subject to rapid technological advancements and shifting customer demands. The constantly evolving landscape requires focused innovation to remain at the forefront of performance, product quality and supply reliability. The industry is increasingly driven by trends such as supply chain localization, cost optimization and sustainability, which present both challenges and opportunities. As one of the largest electronics material providers, we bring the ability to innovate, manufacture and co-develop solutions, which positions us to compete effective","zh":"我們參與的市場競爭是透過一系列基於性能、品質、可靠性、品牌、聲譽、服務和支援的產品和服務進行的。除了新產品開發之外，我們還為客戶提供廣泛的支援、技術服務和測試服務。電子材料市場受到快速技術進步和不斷變化的客戶需求的影響。不斷變化的情況需要集中創新，以保持在性能、產品品質和供應可靠性方面的領先地位。該行業日益受到供應鏈本地化、成本優化和永續發展等趨勢的推動，這既帶來了挑戰，也帶來了機會。作為最大的電子材料供應商之一，我們擁有創新、製造和共同開發解決方案的能力，這使我們能夠有效競爭"},{"en":"The regulatory environment in which we operate is robust and evolving in response to, among other actions, geopolitical forces, technological developments and societal concerns. Our businesses and operations are affected by global laws, regulations and standards. Our production cycle and products are subject to global regulations, such as permitting, quality controls, environmental, health and safety laws and regulations, export control laws, product specifications, market-related policies and distributions regulations. We believe that we maintain processes and procedures that comply with applicable global laws and regulations as they pertain to the various stages of our production life cycle, including the development of our products. However, new, modified or more stringent requirements or enforcement policies could be adopted, which could adversely affect us. Our ability to market, se","zh":"我們所經營的監管環境是穩健的，並且隨著地緣政治力量、技術發展和社會關注等行動而不斷變化。我們的業務和營運受到全球法律、法規和標準的影響。我們的生產週期和產品受到全球法規的約束，例如許可、品質控制、環境、健康和安全法律法規、出口管制法律、產品規格、市場相關政策和分銷法規。我們相信，我們所維護的流程和程序符合適用的全球法律和法規，因為它們涉及我們生產生命週期的各個階段，包括我們產品的開發。然而，可能會採用新的、修改的或更嚴格的要求或執行政策，這可能會對我們產生不利影響。我們的行銷能力、服務能力"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Semiconductor Technologies","val":2642000000,"zh":"半導體技術"},{"name":"Interconnect Solutions","val":2112000000,"zh":"Interconnect Solutions"}],"total":4754000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":3747000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"South Korea Taiwan & Other Asia Pacific","val":2177000000,"zh":"South Korea Taiwan & Other Asia Pacific"},{"name":"CN","val":1570000000,"zh":"中國"},{"name":"Other","val":745000000,"zh":"其他"},{"name":"KR","val":725000000,"zh":"韓國"},{"name":"TW","val":707000000,"zh":"台灣"},{"name":"Americas","val":629000000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"US","val":591000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":378000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Americas Excluding The United States","val":38000000,"zh":"美洲（不包括美國）"}],"total":4754000000}},"peers":["LU","CIEN","COMS","VOD","GLW"]}}